{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q6948247","formula":"C₂₁H₃₉NO₆","hill":"C21H39NO6","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":21.0,"H":39.0,"N":1.0,"O":6.0},"names":{"en":"Myriocin","ru":"Мириоцин"},"descriptions":{"en":"Myriocin, also known as antibiotic ISP-1 and thermozymocidin, is a non-proteinogenic amino acid derived from the entomopathogenic fungus, Isaria sinclairii. Myriocin is a very potent inhibitor of serine palmitoyltransferase, the first step in sphingosine biosynthesis. Due to this property, it is used in biochemical research, as a tool for depleting cells of sphingolipids.","ru":"Мириоцин, или термозимоцидин, (англ. myriocin, thermozymocidin) — органическое вещество естественного происхождения, атипичная аминокислота, антибиотик (известен также под названием ISP-1). Мириоцин синтезируется определёнными термофильными грибками и был выделен, в частности, из Mycelia sterilia и Isaria sinclairii."},"fame":8,"pubchemCid":6438394,"mass":401.5,"charge":0,"smiles":"CCCCCCC(=O)CCCCCC/C=C/C[C@H]([C@@H]([C@@](CO)(C(=O)O)N)O)O","inchikey":"ZZIKIHCNFWXKDY-GNTQXERDSA-N","iupac":"(E,2S,3R,4R)-2-amino-3,4-dihydroxy-2-(hydroxymethyl)-14-oxoicos-6-enoic acid","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"rdkit","ref":"6438394","atoms":67,"license":"Computed with RDKit from SMILES (PubChem, Wikidata)"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-6.474,"y":-2.58,"z":-2.13,"el":"C"},{"x":-6.867,"y":-1.905,"z":-0.824,"el":"C"},{"x":-6.235,"y":-0.519,"z":-0.702,"el":"C"},{"x":-6.684,"y":0.248,"z":0.546,"el":"C"},{"x":-6.381,"y":-0.422,"z":1.893,"el":"C"},{"x":-4.911,"y":-0.765,"z":2.127,"el":"C"},{"x":-4.005,"y":0.454,"z":2.192,"el":"C"},{"x":-4.431,"y":1.564,"z":2.506,"el":"O"},{"x":-2.528,"y":0.196,"z":1.937,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.72,"y":1.467,"z":1.674,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.027,"y":2.073,"z":0.3,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.294,"y":3.393,"z":0.039,"e